{"3952160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Detective Pig", "steam_appid": 3952160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/1f6f0778ffde5b704c77c04a2194c949.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Pig</strong> is more than just a story—it's a tense stealth adventure. Every level challenges you to sneak past hostile pig enemies without being spotted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is at the heart of the gameplay. Think ahead, consider the consequences of every move, and carefully watch the behavior of each enemy pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a60cefd92f31d1cdb25f1029f00eae5e.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a60cefd92f31d1cdb25f1029f00eae5e.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a60cefd92f31d1cdb25f1029f00eae5e.mp4?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a56d62ab8d33b08930a26a554827f068.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Story Campaign combines an engaging narrative with stealth-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before your adventure begins, you'll experience a short prologue that introduces you to the world of <strong>Detective Pig</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tutorial is seamlessly integrated into the game, allowing you to naturally learn every gameplay mechanic as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a2f32f0c9419a12212397ffc7666848f.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a2f32f0c9419a12212397ffc7666848f.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a2f32f0c9419a12212397ffc7666848f.mp4?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a305f70d9fc683306d3749efd50cc5a0.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you'll earn <strong>Pig Coins</strong> and <strong>Cupcakes</strong>. Spend them in the in-game shop to unlock new character skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four skin rarity tiers: <strong>Rare</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, <strong>Legendary</strong>, and <strong>Event</strong>. The higher the rarity, the more unique the appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a7bd5e03edfd40390f6827a4dd38f39b.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a7bd5e03edfd40390f6827a4dd38f39b.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a7bd5e03edfd40390f6827a4dd38f39b.mp4?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a703ef5db59303435b5edea3ea77c8f0.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the world of <strong>Khryunville</strong> as a talented detective. Your very first case brings you to a wealthy and influential family who ask you to do the impossible—find their son, who has vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you delve into the investigation, the more mysteries unfold before you. Gather clues, uncover hidden evidence, and discover who is behind the mysterious disappearance. Only you can uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/5a32943d039b3b0d23a834b8d8c460e9.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/5a32943d039b3b0d23a834b8d8c460e9.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/5a32943d039b3b0d23a834b8d8c460e9.mp4?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/1f6f0778ffde5b704c77c04a2194c949.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Pig</strong> is more than just a story—it's a tense stealth adventure. Every level challenges you to sneak past hostile pig enemies without being spotted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is at the heart of the gameplay. Think ahead, consider the consequences of every move, and carefully watch the behavior of each enemy pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a60cefd92f31d1cdb25f1029f00eae5e.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a60cefd92f31d1cdb25f1029f00eae5e.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a60cefd92f31d1cdb25f1029f00eae5e.mp4?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a56d62ab8d33b08930a26a554827f068.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Story Campaign combines an engaging narrative with stealth-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before your adventure begins, you'll experience a short prologue that introduces you to the world of <strong>Detective Pig</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tutorial is seamlessly integrated into the game, allowing you to naturally learn every gameplay mechanic as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a2f32f0c9419a12212397ffc7666848f.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a2f32f0c9419a12212397ffc7666848f.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a2f32f0c9419a12212397ffc7666848f.mp4?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a305f70d9fc683306d3749efd50cc5a0.avif?t=1787517922\" width=1438 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you'll earn <strong>Pig Coins</strong> and <strong>Cupcakes</strong>. Spend them in the in-game shop to unlock new character skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four skin rarity tiers: <strong>Rare</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, <strong>Legendary</strong>, and <strong>Event</strong>. The higher the rarity, the more unique the appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a7bd5e03edfd40390f6827a4dd38f39b.poster.avif?t=1787517922\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a7bd5e03edfd40390f6827a4dd38f39b.webm?t=1787517922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a7bd5e03edfd40390f6827a4dd3